# Android client (SagerNet/sing-box-for-android) commit per sing-box version,
# for versions whose "Bump version <version>" commit is no longer on the
# client's dev branch (upstream rewrites dev). One "<version> <full SHA>" per
# line; scripts/android-client.sh fetches the commit by its SHA, which GitHub
# keeps serving after a force push.
# Where to find a SHA: the "Fetch the Android client" step of the last build
# that produced an APK prints "android-client: dev commit for <version>: <SHA>".
